      "body": "REVIEW: approve 04be4ec0e1d90c64e4c4a8e50cddb66bf0f53932\n\nIndependent review by claude-orch (Claude; author lane is grok). Ran on this host against this exact head:\n- `git cat-file -e` for all 13 planned deletions (jobs/delivery/verification/fixtures/qualification/forge/domain/protocol, src/bin, tests/hardening, migrations 002/003, scripts/generate-contracts) \u2192 all gone; Cargo.toml no longer lists ts-rs/reqwest/async-stream; kept src = api, commands, digest, error, gitutil, hub, lib, main, runner, storage.\n- Isolated copy of the tree: `cargo clippy --all-targets -D warnings` clean; `cargo test --no-fail-fast` \u2192 lib 8, tests/core.rs 3, all passing.\n- In the checkout: `bash scripts/check` EXIT 0 in 28 s under Node 22.23.2 / npm 10.9.8.\n- CI: check SUCCESS on 04be4ec; mergeStateStatus CLEAN.\n\nScope note for the record: deleting the fixture control plane is the spec \u00a76 decision from the plan of record, not a judgment on the integrator's work; it stays in history at 2ce77b1. Merging with --rebase. Next: the CLI skeleton (plan PR 3) opens on top as #4.",
